  "description": "Meitu, the all-in-one AI photo editor and video editing app!\n5 must-try edit features:\n-AI Flash Effect: Viral vintage camera and retro filters\n-Object Remover: Erase photobombers and blur background in 1 tap\n-Photo Enhancer: Fix blur and restore HD clarity instantly\n-Beauty Retouch & Face Edit: Smooth skin, reshape body & glow naturally\n-AI Art: Create trending avatars, collages & stickers\n\nTerms & Privacy: https://pro.meitu.com/xiuxiu/agreements/gdpr.html?lang=en#en-policy\nContact: global.support@meitu.com",
  "release_notes": "What's new:\n— Eraser for One-Tap Beauty: erase just the spots that look off, plus an upgraded Body effect\n— Adjustable Plump & Lift: turn them on for photos, videos, or Live Photos, then set the strength with a slider\n— Smarter AI Assistant: circle the area you want changed and ask, or erase parts you don't want\n— Video: new Low-Light Fix, Color Boost, and Noise Reduction, plus Slim Forearms in Body Shape\nUpdate to the latest version to try it out!",
